This product is built with and depends on the NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit for
accelerator enumeration, probing, and validation on NVIDIA CUDA-capable
devices. CUDA is a trademark of NVIDIA Corporation.

This product optionally integrates with the NVIDIA Management Library (NVML)
where it is present on the host. When NVML is absent the runtime continues
to function using the CUDA Runtime and CUDA Driver APIs alone; NVML is an
optional integration and its absence is not a runtime failure.

No telemetry, analytics, or network-beaconing code is included in this
product. GPU Fleet Agent performs no data transmission to third parties.
